# Aquarium 静态配置必须入库：干净检出缺 ACTIVE_CONFIG 会退回 foundation 配置，
# 缺 sale-switch.json 则部署后找不到可改的开关文件。运行时数据仍忽略。
!source/plugin/gamecenter/games/aquarium/data/
source/plugin/gamecenter/games/aquarium/data/*
!source/plugin/gamecenter/games/aquarium/data/ACTIVE_CONFIG
!source/plugin/gamecenter/games/aquarium/data/content-v1-candidate.json
!source/plugin/gamecenter/games/aquarium/data/content-v2-candidate.json
!source/plugin/gamecenter/games/aquarium/data/sale-switch.json
